nar-Charged damage, CRIT DMG and Energy after triggering Lunar-Charged."},{"name":"Staff of the Scarlet Sands","text":"Provides 44.1% CRIT Rate and converts EM into bonus ATK, making it Flins’s second-best 5-star option for Lunar-Charged damage."},{"name":"Fractured Halo","text":"CRIT DMG and ATK after Skill or Burst. Its Lunar-Charged team buff requires the wielder to create a shield, so Flins cannot normally activate it. Shield-creation passive unavailable."},{"name":"Staff of Homa","text":"High CRIT DMG and HP-scaling ATK. Strong general offensive stats even above half HP."},{"name":"Primordial Jade Winged-Spear","text":"CRIT Rate and stacking ATK with hits; needs field time to reach full stacks."},{"name":"Deathmatch","text":"Battle Pass CRIT Rate with an ATK bonus based on nearby enemy count."},{"name":"Tamayuratei no Ohanashi","text":"Provides 30.6% Energy Recharge and increases ATK after triggering an Elemental Skill, helping Flins maintain Burst uptime and damage."},{"name":"Prospector's Shovel","text":"Provides 41.3% ATK and up to 48% Lunar-Charged DMG Bonus at R5, making it Flins’s best craftable F2P option."}],"a":[{"names":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"text":"Grants EM and extra CRIT Rate during Lunar reactions. The higher bonus depends on Moonsign level, making it ideal for Flins teams.","stats":"ATK% · ATK% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Thundering Fury"],"text":"Provides 15% Electro DMG and 20% Lunar-Charged DMG, with Skill cooldown reduction. A strong alternative for Flins, especially in teams with Fischl.","stats":""},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale","Gilded Dreams"],"text":"Provides 18% ATK and 80 EM, offering a flexible alternative for boosting Flins’s ATK and reaction damage.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Thunder Down Under","members":["Flins","Columbina","Sucrose","Ineffa"],"text":"Flins drives Lunar-Charged damage, Columbina buffs Lunar reactions, Sucrose boosts EM and shreds RES, and Ineffa adds off-field Electro and shielding.","roles":["Main DPS","Lunar","EM Build","Support"]},{"name":"Watt the Flins","members":["Flins","Aino","Sucrose","Ineffa"],"text":"Flins deals Lunar Charged damage while Aino supplies Hydro. Ineffa adds off field Electro damage and shielding, and Sucrose groups enemies and shares EM.","roles":["Main DPS","Reaction","EM Build","Support"]},{"name":"Birds of Prey","members":["Flins","Columbina","Ineffa","Fischl"],"text":"Flins leads the Lunar Charged damage while Columbina supports Lunar reactions. Ineffa adds shielding and Electro damage, and Fischl contributes Oz damage.","roles":["Main DPS","Lunar","Support","Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Low Current Balance","members":["Flins","Aino","Sucrose","Fischl"],"text":"Flins drives Lunar Charged reactions with Aino’s Hydro application. Sucrose shares EM and groups enemies, while Fischl adds off field Electro damage.","roles":["Main DPS","Reaction","EM Build","Sub DPS"]}],"v":"Premium Lunar-Charged: Prioritize Lunar-Charged damage in teams that maintain their Moonsign bonuses.\nAccessible Lunar Carry: Lower-cost weapon route using the same Lunar-Charged game plan.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Flins is an Electro DPS who unleashes devastating Lunar Charged damage through his Elemental Bursts. He’s easy to play and hits hard, but his best performance depends on the right teammates.","pros":["Massive Burst damage","Strong AoE DMG","Straightforward gameplay","Good damage even at C0"],"cons":["Relies heavily on Lunar Charged","Needs the right team setup","Damage drops without proper team synergy"],"weapons":["Bloodsoaked Ruins","Staff of the Scarlet Sands","Fractured Halo","Staff of Homa","Primordial Jade Winged-Spear","Deathmatch","Tamayuratei no Ohanashi","Prospector's Shovel"],"arts":[{"sets":["Night Of The Sky'S Unveiling"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Main DPS"}],"main":["ATK%","ATK%","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"